WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:02.400
What's up everybody!

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:03.780
We are Pongfinity

00:00:03.780 --> 00:00:06.160
Today we will be taking over my university

00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:07.660
Hanken School of Economics

00:00:07.660 --> 00:00:09.820
A very international business school in Finland

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:11.140
This will be fun!

00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:29.160
Thanks!

00:00:52.520 --> 00:00:54.120
That was an interesting serve!

00:01:11.640 --> 00:01:14.680
Hanken is a triple accredited business school.

00:01:14.680 --> 00:01:18.740
That means it has earned all three big quality international labels

00:01:19.060 --> 00:01:21.060
Here is a target shot for each one of them!

00:01:30.260 --> 00:01:31.520
Triple Crown!

00:01:43.640 --> 00:01:44.600
Second one in a row

00:02:13.100 --> 00:02:14.533
Around the plants

00:02:14.540 --> 00:02:15.540
Hit the cup

00:02:15.600 --> 00:02:16.480
Let's go!

00:02:28.300 --> 00:02:31.360
Hanken offers a two years master's
program in English

00:02:31.420 --> 00:02:33.720
You can study: marketing, finance, economics,

00:02:33.760 --> 00:02:36.460
management,
accounting and commercial law.

00:03:03.040 --> 00:03:04.800
It was a nice sound!

00:03:06.980 --> 00:03:09.200
Now let's check out the classrooms!

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:17.580
This is classroom table tennis!

00:03:46.520 --> 00:03:47.800
Let's make Miikka run!

00:04:28.720 --> 00:04:29.880
Watch this!

00:04:33.660 --> 00:04:35.660
Nice trick shot, Otto!

00:04:54.220 --> 00:04:55.360
C'mon!

00:04:58.160 --> 00:04:59.840
And this is the Hanken Business Lab

00:04:59.880 --> 00:05:02.100
A place for start-ups and entrepreneurs.

00:05:23.340 --> 00:05:24.780
That's how you do it!

00:05:28.220 --> 00:05:30.440
Huge thanks to Hanken for sponsoring this video

00:05:30.440 --> 00:05:32.080
We had a lot of fun filming here!

00:05:32.260 --> 00:05:36.140
Finland is a great place to study:
it's a safe country with a lot of friendly people

00:05:36.140 --> 00:05:38.420
If you are interested in studying at Hanken

00:05:38.420 --> 00:05:40.160
Make sure to check out the link in the description

00:05:40.160 --> 00:05:42.120
to find more information about the school!

00:05:42.120 --> 00:05:43.240
Until next time!

